  "compiled_truth": "AI can reveal new cell biology - by Michael Spencer\n            \n            \n            \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n\n        \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n                \n            \n        \n\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n            \n        \n            \n                \n    